    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "💡 This table summarizes the main findings of the analysis. Each row follows the same logic: Insight (what we found), Evidence (the numbers that support it), and Recommendation (what to do next)."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Averages can mislead: Average GDP is 243bn but the median is 16.25bn, and average inflation is 5.86 vs a median of 3.2. A few extreme countries pull the averages up, so the median should be shown next to every average."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Trade: 154 of the 223 countries with trade data run a deficit, against 69 with a surplus. The global total is close to zero by construction, so trade balance is most useful per country and per region."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Growth: Most countries fall in Moderate Growth (85) or High Growth (56), and 9 are contracting. High growth should be checked against a low starting base before it is read as a strength."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Data quality: Oil imports are missing for 80.5% of countries and oil exports for 75.3%, so energy comparisons rest on few countries and must state how many have data."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Note: the data appears to date from around 2005, so these findings describe that period, not today."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
